description:
Design a combinational logic circuit that processes a 4-bit input value. If the input is within the range of 0 to 7, the output is the input value multiplied by 2 (left shift by one). If the input is within the range of 8 to 15, the output is the input value divided by 2 (right shift by one). For any input outside the range of 0 to 15, the output is set to 0.
module top_module(
  input [3:0] in,
  output reg [3:0] out
);

code:
module top_module(
  input [3:0] in,
  output reg [3:0] out
);always @(*)
  begin
    if (in >= 0 && in <= 7) // Range 0 to 7
      out = in << 1;
    else if (in >= 8 && in <= 15) // Range 8 to 15
      out = in >> 1;
    else // Outside range 0 to 15
      out = 0;
  end

endmodule

